\code{\link[=supported_targets]{supported_targets()}}, \code{\link[=compiled_targets]{compiled_targets()}}, \code{\link[=dispatched_target]{dispatched_target()}}) and
provide small demonstration kernels (\code{\link[=hwy_demo_exp]{hwy_demo_exp()}}, \code{\link[=hwy_demo_log]{hwy_demo_log()}},
\code{\link[=hwy_demo_sum]{hwy_demo_sum()}}).

Licensing and the list of local changes to the bundled library are in
